 best-known power?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Super-speed","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Invisibility","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Talking to and commanding sea life","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Flight","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"His marine telepathy is his trademark, though he is also super-strong and nearly invulnerable."},{"id":"q7","question":"Aquaman was a founding member of which 1960 super-team?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Teen Titans","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Justice Society of America","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Doom Patrol","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Justice League of America","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"The Justice League formed in The Brave and the Bold #28 (1960); the Justice Society was the earlier 1940s team."},{"id":"q8","question":"Who played Aquaman in the 2018 solo film?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Henry Cavill","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Jason Momoa","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Chris Hemsworth","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Zachary Levi","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Jason Momoa first played Aquaman in Batman v Superman (2016) and starred in Aquaman (2018) and The Lost Kingdom (2023)."}]'::jsonb,
